title: "Aniultimatium: free IPTV player (M3U and Xtream) and anime app for Samsung Tizen, Android TV and Fire TV"
abstract: "Free, open-source IPTV player for your own M3U or Xtream playlist with a fast channel browser, TV guide, phone/QR setup, plus English sub and dub anime, movies and TV shows, for Samsung Tizen TVs (4.0+), Android TV and Fire TV."
